@page "/"

<PageTitle>ProTouch Clinic | Physiotherapy-led fitness</PageTitle>

<section class="public-hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
        <img class="public-brand-logo" src="/images/sri-sai-protouch-logo.svg" alt="Sri Sai Protouch — Dr. Manjari, physiotherapist and slimming expert" />
        <p class="eyebrow">PROTOUCH CLINIC • PHYSIOTHERAPY & FITNESS</p>
        <h1>Fitness that works <em>with</em> your body.</h1>
        <p class="hero-lead">A physiotherapist plays a major role in building workouts that are safe, effective and personal—especially when pain, injury, mobility limits or other health concerns are already part of your story.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="btn-clinic" href="#book">Book an appointment <span>→</span></a>
            <a class="btn-clinic-secondary" href="https://wa.me/919028027888?text=Hello%20Dr.%20Manjari%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20know%20about%20physiotherapy-led%20fitness." target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp Dr. Manjari</a>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-line"><span>✓ Movement-first care</span><span>✓ Personal diet guidance</span><span>✓ Long-lasting results</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual">
        <img src="/images/clinic-gallery/WhatsApp Image 2026-08-12 at 12.21.53 AM (1).jpeg" alt="ProTouch clinic care" />
        <div class="hero-note"><strong>Care beyond the scale</strong><span>Reduce weight while helping minimise the biological problems behind it.</span></div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="public-section intro-section">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">OUR APPROACH</p><h2>Your goal is bigger than weight loss.</h2></div>
    <p class="section-lead">We look beyond a number on the scale. By addressing pain, movement patterns, strength, sleep, nutrition and day-to-day habits together, we help create results that are safer to achieve and easier to keep.</p>
</section>

<section class="public-section services-section" id="services">
    <div class="section-title"><p class="eyebrow">WHAT WE SUPPORT</p><h2>Care shaped around the person, not a template.</h2></div>
    <div class="service-grid">
        <article class="service-card"><span>01</span><h3>Physiotherapy-led workouts</h3><p>Build strength, mobility and confidence with exercises adapted around pain, injury and current ability.</p></article>
        <article class="service-card"><span>02</span><h3>Weight management</h3><p>Progress with clinically mindful movement and nutrition—not punishing routines or short-term fixes.</p></article>
        <article class="service-card"><span>03</span><h3>Pain & mobility support</h3><p>Address everyday movement restrictions so fitness becomes possible, comfortable and sustainable.</p></article>
        <article class="service-card"><span>04</span><h3>Personalised diet charts</h3><p>Receive diet guidance designed for your needs, then view it any time from your client portal.</p></article>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="public-section care-band">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">CONNECTED CARE</p><h2>Your plan stays with you between visits.</h2></div>
    <div class="care-points"><div><b>01</b><p>Book clinic appointments directly online.</p></div><div><b>02</b><p>Track morning weight and daily progress securely.</p></div><div><b>03</b><p>See treatment records, personalised diet charts and payment reminders in one client space.</p></div></div>
</section>

<section class="public-section portal-section">
    <div class="portal-panel"><p class="eyebrow">CLIENT PORTAL</p><h2>Clear progress. Personal guidance.</h2><p>Clients can log morning weight, review their treatment plan and attendance, see diet guidance from the clinic and manage appointments.</p><a href="Account/Login" class="text-link">Open client portal →</a></div>
    <div class="portal-panel dark"><p class="eyebrow">CLINIC MANAGEMENT</p><h2>Personal care at scale.</h2><p>Our admin workspace keeps client treatments, tailored notes, payment reminders and WhatsApp communication organised in one secure place.</p><a href="Account/Login" class="text-link">Staff sign in →</a></div>
</section>

<section class="public-section gallery-section">
    <div class="section-title"><p class="eyebrow">INSIDE PROTOUCH</p><h2>Our clinic, our community, our care.</h2></div>
    <div class="clinic-gallery">
        @foreach (var image in galleryImages)
        {
            <img src="@($"/images/clinic-gallery/{image}")" alt="ProTouch Clinic" loading="lazy" />
        }
    </div>
</section>

<section class="public-section booking-section" id="book">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">START WITH A CONVERSATION</p><h2>Let’s build a safer way forward.</h2><p>Contact Dr. Manjari to discuss your fitness, pain-management or weight-management needs.</p></div>
    <div class="contact-card"><span>Call or WhatsApp</span><a href="tel:+919028027888">+91 90280 27888</a><strong>Dr. Manjari</strong><a class="btn-clinic w-100 justify-content-center mt-4" target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://wa.me/919028027888?text=Hello%20Dr.%20Manjari%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20book%20an%20appointment.">Book on WhatsApp</a></div>
</section>

